<figure class="illo illo-4" role="group" aria-label="Fifty tool definitions in context compared with two meta-tools plus a searchable tool index">
  <style is:global>
    .illo-4 {
      margin: 2.2em 0;
      padding: clamp(18px, 3vw, 26px);
      background: var(--color-panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-hairline);
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
    }
    .illo-4 .cols { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 18px; align-items: start; }
    .illo-4 .hd {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--color-text-faint);
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }
    .illo-4 .card {
      background: var(--color-surface-deep);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 14px;
    }
    .illo-4 .card.small {
      border-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-accent) 45%, transparent);
    }
    .illo-4 .tools { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 5px; }
    .illo-4 .t {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 10.5px;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      background: var(--color-surface-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-hairline);
      border-radius: 5px;
      padding: 5px 7px;
      line-height: 1;
    }
    .illo-4 .t.more { color: var(--color-text-faint); }
    .illo-4 .t.meta {
      color: var(--color-accent);
      border-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-accent) 40%, transparent);
      background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-accent) 7%, transparent);
      font-size: 11.5px;
      padding: 8px 10px;
    }
    .illo-4 .mrow {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 10.5px;
      color: var(--color-text-dim);
      margin: 14px 0 6px;
    }
    .illo-4 .meter { height: 7px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--color-surface-2); overflow: hidden; }
    .illo-4 .meter div { height: 100%; border-radius: 4px; }
    .illo-4 .meter .hot { width: 88%; background: var(--color-text-dim); }
    .illo-4 .meter .cool { width: 9%; background: var(--color-accent); }
    .illo-4 .link {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 10.5px;
      color: var(--color-text-dim);
      margin: 10px 0 0;
    }
    .illo-4 .link svg { flex: none; }
    .illo-4 .index {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 10px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: var(--color-surface-deep);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }
    .illo-4 .index .txt { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.5; }
    .illo-4 .index .txt b { color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 500; display: block; }
    .illo-4 figcaption {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--color-text-dim);
      margin-top: 16px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 560px) { .illo-4 .cols { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  </style>

  <div class="cols">
    <div>
      <p class="hd">Every tool in the prompt</p>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="tools">
          <span class="t">read</span><span class="t">write</span><span class="t">grep</span>
          <span class="t">list_dir</span><span class="t">exec</span><span class="t">http_get</span>
          <span class="t">sql_query</span><span class="t">k8s_apply</span><span class="t">jira_create</span>
          <span class="t">slack_post</span><span class="t">pd_ack</span><span class="t">s3_put</span>
          <span class="t">metrics_query</span><span class="t">log_search</span><span class="t">git_diff</span>
          <span class="t more">+ 45 more definitions</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mrow"><span>context spent before any work</span><span>88%</span></div>
        <div class="meter"><div class="hot"></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="hd">Two meta-tools + an index</p>
      <div class="card small">
        <div class="tools">
          <span class="t meta">search_tools</span><span class="t meta">call_tool</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mrow"><span>context spent before any work</span><span>9%</span></div>
        <div class="meter"><div class="cool"></div></div>
      </div>

      <p class="link">
        <svg width="14" height="10" viewBox="0 0 14 10" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 5h11M8 1.5 11.5 5 8 8.5" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.2"/></svg>
        describe the need
      </p>

      <div class="index">
        <svg width="34" height="42" viewBox="0 0 34 42" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M1 8v26c0 3.9 7.2 7 16 7s16-3.1 16-7V8" fill="var(--d-fill-pg)" stroke="var(--d-teal)"/>
          <ellipse cx="17" cy="8" rx="16" ry="7" fill="var(--d-fill-soft)" stroke="var(--d-teal)"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="txt"><b>tool index</b>~800 tools · semantic search</span>
      </div>

      <p class="link">
        <svg width="14" height="10" viewBox="0 0 14 10" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 5H3M6 1.5 2.5 5 6 8.5" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.2"/></svg>
        top 2 matches come back
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption>The catalog lives in a search index, not in the prompt. Every tool stays reachable; almost none of them are carried.</figcaption>
</figure>
